.TH MENU_HANDLE_INPUT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
menu_handle_input \- Move the selection with up/down keys, dpad, or mouse hover; activate with Enter, space, pad south, or a click
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmenu.h\(dq
.BI "void menu_handle_input(Menu *m, Engine *e, const Input *in);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move the selection with up/down keys, dpad, or mouse hover; activate with Enter, space, pad south, or a click. Call from the owning scene's handle_input.
.SH MODULE
menu (src/engine/menu/menu.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR menu_render (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
